TEMPLATE: Thoughtful email

TEXT:
  Hello {{$name}},

  {{$message}}

  {{$closing}},
  {{$sender}}
  {{$notes}}

$name: Who are you writing to?
  EXAMPLE: Alex

$message: What would you like to say?
  HINT: Keep your message focused on one clear idea.
  INPUT: multiline
  EXAMPLE: Thank you for reviewing the project. Your feedback made a real difference.

$closing: How would you like to sign off?
  OPTION thanks: Thank you
  OPTION regards: Kind regards
  OPTION best: All the best

$sender: What is your name?
  EXAMPLE: Morgan

$notes OPTIONAL: Anything to add below your signature?
  HINT: This line can stay empty.
  EXAMPLE: P.S. The next draft will be ready on Friday.
